## Third-party materials and facts

This repository cites or links to patents, regulatory filings, standards,
annual reports, academic papers, company disclosures, media reports and other
third-party sources.

The repository's licenses **do not relicense those third-party works**.
Copyright, database rights, trademarks and other rights in third-party source
materials remain with their respective owners.

The project generally stores links and Xiangsee-created structured facts /
annotations rather than redistributing third-party source documents.

